-- damocles.talk: a Library (ADR 0020), registered on the Damocles Group
-- with group.addLibrary({ name: "damocles", version: "1", source }).
-- It holds only code that every Damocles Script shares. It has no Script
-- Variables, no `me` and no Grants of its own. Its `ask display …` is
-- checked against each importer's Grants when that importer loads.

-- How long a blank line holds: 50 frames at 50 Hz.
constant blankHold = 1 s

-- Shared epilogue $072CAE (62 original scripts use it). Clears the line,
-- then holds it blank. `display.clear` is suspending, so this Handler may
-- suspend, and every call to it must be written `epilogue and wait`.
on epilogue
  ask display to clear {for: blankHold} and wait
end epilogue

-- Not importable. Used only by `sayAll`.
private function isBlank id
  return id is ""
end isBlank

-- Says each string id in turn, skipping blanks. Every Body's landing text
-- goes through this. It suspends (`say` is suspending), so callers write
-- `sayAll ids and wait`.
on sayAll ids
  repeat for each id in ids
    if not isBlank(id) then ask display to say id and wait
  end repeat
end sayAll

-- Load errors, if a Library tried them (ADR 0020):
--   set the encounterGate of session to 1   -- well-known object name
--   send epilogue to me                     -- no `me`, no `send`
--   wait for keypress k                     -- whose mailbox?
